IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `scr-dates`

-- Supreme Court (General Civil Procedure) Rules 2025 (Vic) -- the steps a party must take within a time, as regulative
-- rules, and the helper that runs one over what happened.
--
-- Each duty is "PARTY the party who must take the step MUST the step WITHIN the days allowed", the days counted from the
-- day of the event that starts the time to the last day for the step (worked out by Order 3 in scr-dates.l4). The
-- questions that use them (in scr-process.l4, scr-evidence.l4 and scr-costs.l4) take only dates and yes/no facts; no
-- question takes a DEONTIC or an EVENT. Nothing here is exported.
--
-- UNOFFICIAL VERSION: quotations from a plain-text conversion by Legalese Commons of the Word file of the Supreme Court
-- (General Civil Procedure) Rules 2025, S.R. No. 85/2025, Version No. 003 (1 January 2026), not the authorised version.
